Omymind’s meditation, breathing, sleep, audio, focus, and related content is intended for general relaxation, self-regulation, and lifestyle use.

Omymind does not provide:

- medical diagnosis;
- psychological diagnosis;
- disease treatment or prevention;
- a substitute for doctors, therapists, psychologists, or other qualified professionals.

If you experience serious physical symptoms, persistent sleep problems, psychological crisis, or another condition requiring professional support, seek qualified help promptly.

Use meditation, breathing, and audio content according to your own condition. Stop using a feature if it causes significant discomfort.

---

