Some Omymind content may be generated or assisted by artificial intelligence.

You understand that:

- AI output may contain errors, bias, or inaccuracies;
- the same input may produce different results at different times;
- AI content is for general experience and reference only and is not medical, psychological, legal, financial, or other professional advice;
- you are responsible for deciding whether to rely on or use AI-generated content.

Do not rely solely on AI output for important decisions.

---

